00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,330
An AI match report can sound convincing. But can you prove what

2
00:00:05,330 --> 00:00:12,000
it says? CRONISTA makes every published sentence inspectable, right down to
the events behind it.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,840
Our simulator creates fictional football matches. A deterministic Analyst
extracts facts and

4
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:23,680
links them to events. The Writer turns those facts into English and

5
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:30,000
Spanish. Then the Verifier checks citations, numbers, names, and supported
claims before publication.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,290
The Writer runs on Microsoft Foundry through Azure OpenAI. This view shows

7
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:40,590
its actual drafts and verdicts. Rejected output gets feedback and a limited

8
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:45,000
