9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,450
Click a sentence and its evidence lights up. Switch languages or inspect

10
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:55,910
the underlying facts. Player ratings also unfold into the events that earned

11
00:00:55,910 --> 00:01:00,000
