15
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:23,210
Everything is synthetic: teams, players, events. The downloadable dataset
includes its methodology

16
00:01:23,210 --> 00:01:29,410
and statistical checks. Automated tests exercise the simulator, verification
rules, and the

17
00:01:29,410 --> 00:01:32,000
