18
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:37,140
Across twenty real-model matches, both the baseline and pipeline passed these
checks.

19
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:42,290
That sample showed no reduction in findings, and our verifier has documented

20
00:01:42,290 --> 00:01:47,430
